{"availability":"available","full":"HMarzban/fusegrid","name":"fusegrid","description":"A browser arcade game with a deterministic simulation, replay tests, and switchable 2D and 3D renderers.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-01T10:48:32Z","updated":"2026-10-11T07:18:08Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://hmarzban.github.io/fusegrid/","topics":["browser-game","canvas","deterministic-simulation","javascript","pwa","threejs","webgl"],"demo":"https://hmarzban.github.io/fusegrid/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.224Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.224Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.224Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.224Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["FUSE/GRID is a single-player, deterministic bomb-grid arcade you play in the browser. Flip REAL 3D ⇄ CLASSIC 2D from the cabinet menu, pick your Heat on LEVEL SELECT, and clear every enemy to advance.","Share that URL with the trailing slash so chat apps load the preview card (og.png, 1200×630). The no-slash redirect drops Open Graph tags."],"features":["Opening — a FUSE/GRID title waits for any key or tap, which starts the music and a 4 s show that blasts open the menu. Any key skips the show.","REAL 3D ⇄ CLASSIC 2D, plus PIXEL — OPTIONS → RENDER cycles three looks with no reload: CLASSIC 2D (Canvas), PIXEL (hand-drawn sprites over the same board) and REAL 3D (WebGL). REAL 3D frames the whole board from one 3/4…","GRAPHICS — a page under OPTIONS (and in the pause menu) that sets image quality and frame rate together: QUALITY BATTERY / AUTO / HIGH in one press, or tune FRAME RATE (30 / 60 / MAX), RESOLUTION, SHADOWS, ANTI-ALIAS,…","Heat — CORE / PLUS / MAX on LEVEL SELECT (↑/↓). CORE is the baseline run; PLUS and MAX tighten fuse, spawns, and pressure.","Eight rooms — five biomes on a fresh install (JUNGLE → ARENA), then SAND, VOID, and CROWN after your first clear."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HMarzban/fusegrid/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e720551aa9d9abbb6369feb233123fb0ffaf0ad8b361d04a069af28624fa115e","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.330Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.330Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"FUSE/GRID is a single-player, deterministic bomb-grid arcade you play in the browser. Flip REAL 3D ⇄ CLASSIC 2D from the cabinet menu, pick your Heat on LEVEL SELECT, and clear every enemy to advance.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HMarzban/fusegrid/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Everything the game remembers lives in your browser's local storage; there is no account, server, or leaderboard.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HMarzban/fusegrid/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e720551aa9d9abbb6369feb233123fb0ffaf0ad8b361d04a069af28624fa115e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HMarzban/fusegrid/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.330Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T07:18:08Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HMarzban/fusegrid/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.331Z","hash":"e720551aa9d9abbb6369feb233123fb0ffaf0ad8b361d04a069af28624fa115e","originalBytes":10069,"storedBytes":10069,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["stats","board","first","play","room","after","run","pact","core","heat","clear","copy","game","max","plus","rooms","screen","every","fuse","install","key","level","medals","one","real","tap","any","bomb","cabinet","camera","end","finale","fusegrid","local","menu","needs","only","pause","remote","reset","same","throw","baseline","best","browser","during","enter","grid","high","how","kick","media","off","open","options","over","pace","render","select","short","show","start","test","time","under","unlocks","arena","button","cancels","classic","code","copies","cubes",